                            "title":  "Define Quantitative Deviation Thresholds",
                            "detail":  "The current SOP relies on \u0027judgement\u0027 to identify deviations. To ensure consistency and meet SEBI/BRSR requirements, specific percentage thresholds should be defined for automated flagging.",
                            "proposed_text":  "Identify any metrics that deviate by \u003e5% from the target or \u003e10% from the prior year reporting period. Such deviations are automatically classified as \u0027Significant\u0027 and require root cause analysis.",
